"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/81b682dd-45cb-4492-809e-d9e8ebbf5600-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/81b682dd-45cb-4492-809e-d9e8ebbf5600-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If your circuit is unitary, you can convert it to a "
"[`Gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate)  by "
"using the "
"[`to_gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#to_gate)"
" method. "
"[`Gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate) "
"objects are specific types of instructions that have some extra features, "
"such as the "
"[`control`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate#control)"
" method, which adds a quantum control.\n"
msgstr ""
"Falls dein Schaltkreis unitär ist, kannst du ihn mit der "
"[`to_gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#to_gate)"
" Methode in ein "
"[`Gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate) "
"konvertieren. "
"[`Gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate) "
"Objekte sind spezielle Arten von Instruktionen, die einige zusätzliche "
"Funktionen haben, wie z.B. die "
"[`control`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate#control)"
" Methode, die eine Quantenkontrolle hinzufügt.\n"

